  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gulf Solar and Solar with Battery Energy Storage Systems Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADB&#x2019;s assistance will support Gulf Energy Development Public Company Limited&apos;s (GED) long-term target to achieve net-zero greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions by 2050, and Thailand&#x2019;s 5-gigawatt (GW) renewable energy feed-in-tariff (FIT) program for 2022-2030. The FIT program will double Thailand&#x2019;s wind and solar capacity, making a meaningful contribution to Thailand&#x2019;s climate commitments. The ADB-supported project will promote the deployment of solar-BESS plants which is critical to the integration of a growing share of renewable energy capacity and the decarbonization of the energy sector.</narrative>
  </description>
